1. d4 g6 2. e4 Bg7 3. c4 d6 4. f4 {A doubtful method against the Robatsch} (4.
Nc3 $142) 4... Nc6 5. Be3 (5. Nf3 $142) 5... e5 6. dxe5 $8 (6. Nf3 exf4) (6.
fxe5 Qh4+) (6. d5 exf4 $1) 6... dxe5 7. Nc3 exf4 8. Qxd8+ Nxd8 9. Bxf4 Ne6 10.
Bd2 {There is no reason to allow 11...Bxc3+.} Nf6 {[34']} 11. Nf3 {[19']} O-O
12. Bd3 $2 {Losing a Pawn due to playing too quickly.} Nc5 13. Bc2 Nfxe4 14.
Nd5 $2 {Trying for some counterplay.} (14. Nxe4 $142) 14... Nxd2 15. Nxd2 Bxb2
16. Rb1 Be5 17. Rb5 b6 18. Ne4 Ba6 19. Rb4 Nxe4 20. Bxe4 Rae8 21. Ra4 Bc8 22.
Kd2 {or else I lose the Bishop.} c6 {['86']} 23. Nb4 Rd8+ 24. Ke3 ({If} 24. Kc2
Rd4) 24... Bd4+ 25. Kf3 b5 26. cxb5 cxb5 27. Ra3 Bc5 28. Rb3 Be6 29. Rb2 f5 30.
Bc2 a5 31. Re1 Bc4 32. Nc6 Bd5+ {Playing much too quickly. A failing which
persisted throughout this tournament. D.V. Mardle won the tournament. Source:
Dick Collins scorebook, contributed by Sean Parker, 19 December 2022.} 0-1

