gets his draw by perpetual check.} cxd4 11. Nxc6 dxe3 ({I didn't have time to
work it all out but} 11... bxc6 {may have been best to avoid the draw.}) 12.
Bxf6 exd2+ (12... exf2+ {isn't good enough.}) 13. Qxd2 gxf6 14. Qh6 f5 15. Qg5+
