{Time limit 40 moves in 1hr} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3
a6 6. Bc4 e6 7. Bb3 Be7 8. Be3 O-O 9. f4 b5 10. a3 Bb7 11. Qf3 Nbd7 12. Qg3 $2
{Playing too quickly (total time for game about 10')} Bxe4 $2 (12... Nxe4 $1 {
threatens 13...Bh4 and therefore wins a pawn.}) 13. Bxe6 $1 fxe6 $4 ({Black
was even playing faster than me. However, he was lost anyway, e.g.} 13... Nh5
14. Qh3 Nhf6 15. Nxe4 {, etc.}) 14. Nxe6 Qc8 $2 ({A last try was} 14... Nh5 15.
Qg4 Qe8 ({probably better} 15... Bf5) 16. Nxf8 Nxf8 17. Nxe4) 15. Qxg7# {
Source: Dick Collins scorebook, contributed by Sean Parker, 19 December 2022.}
1-0

