Kh7 Qa7+ 70. Qef7 Qa8 71. Qg4+ $4 Ke3 $4 {We both thought the Pawn was going
the other way.} 72. Qb3+ Kf2 73. Qd4+ {E.H.Donovan & J.S.Bennett came =1st
with 4/5 I came =3rd with P.H.Collins. Source: Dick Collins scorebook,
contributed by Sean Parker, 19 December 2022.} 1-0

