Ba6 {As recommended to me a couple of days before by P.J.Adams!} 6. c4 O-O 7.
O-O c5 8. d5 d6 9. h3 e6 10. e4 Qd7 ({Better} 10... Nbd7 {then 11...e5.}) 11.
Nc3 Ne8 {Hoping to get 12...f5 in.} 12. f5 e5 13. Be3 {[25']} Nc7 {[9']} 14. a4
Qe7 15. Qd2 Nd7 16. g4 {[30']} f6 {[13'] Hoping to get 17......g5 in.} 17. fxg6
{[34']} hxg6 {[13']} 18. Nh4 Kh7 $1 19. Nf3 {[39']} Bc8 {[16']} 20. Kh2 Rf7 21.
g5 Kg8 22. gxf6 Bxf6 23. Rg1 Nf8 24. Rg3 $2 Bh4 25. Nxh4 Qxh4 26. Bg5 Qh5 27.
Be2 {[47']} Qh7 {[22']} 28. Bg4 a6 29. Nd1 Ne8 30. Nf2 Nf6 $2 {Up to here my
defensive play had been very good.} 31. Be6 $1 Bxe6 32. dxe6 Nxe6 33. Qxd6 Nxg5
34. Rxg5 Qh4 35. Rxg6+ Kh7 36. Rg2 Qf4+ 37. Kh1 Qf3 38. Qxe5 Nh5 39. Qg5 $1 Nf4
({I didn't reckon much on my chances after...} 39... Rg7 40. Qf5+ Qxf5 {etc.})
40. Qh4+ Nh5 41. Ng4 Kh8 42. Qxh5+ Rh7 43. Qe5+ Rg7 44. Qg3 Qxe4 45. Qh4+ Kg8
46. Nf6+ {Source: Dick Collins scorebook, contributed by Sean Parker, 19
December 2022.} 1-0

